Make a sourcebook PDF of the jpg clippings and .txt file dump of the OCR versions

1. Copy all .jpg and .ocr files to a subdirectory along with ~/projects/wp2latex/makesourcebook.py
2. Edit makesourcebook.py near top to create settings
3. ./makesourcebook.py
4. pdflatex project_sourcebook.tex
   pdflatex project_sourcebook.tex (run twice)
5. awk 'FNR==1 {sub(".ocr$", "", FILENAME); print "\n---------------------------------\n" FILENAME "\n---------------------------------"} 1' *.ocr > project_sourcebook.txt
6. Upload to archive.org
